 "description": "Sixteen anaesthetics of an hour each, from 08:00 to 09:00, all in May 2024 but the last. Four children have saturations of 97 at 08:00, 08:30 and 09:00 (990007301 to 990007304); a fifth child has two such anaesthetics, the first with a saturation of exactly 90 at 08:30 (990007305 and 990007306). Five children fall to 85 at 08:10 and recover to 96 at 08:13, between readings of 97 at 08:00 and 09:00 (990007307 to 990007311); of these, one also has a reading of 80 at 08:30 that was not accepted, and one a reading of 80 at 07:50, before the start. One child reads 88 at 08:10 and 08:15 and 96 at 08:20 (990007312). One child reads 85 every five minutes from 08:00 to 08:15, 97 at 08:20 and 85 again at 08:40, with no later reading (990007313). One child has only cuff pressures (990007314). A test patient falls to 80 (990007315). The last anaesthetic, in May 2023, has the same readings as 990007307 (990007316).",
